{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周二（10日）氣溫逐步下降至早上市區最低約17°C，新界再低一兩度。日間非常乾燥，相對濕度最低35%，最高氣溫約23°C。吹清勁偏北風，初時離岸吹強風，高地達烈風程度，稍後轉吹和緩東北風。周三（11日）日夜溫差頗大，早上新界仍然清涼。本周後期氣溫回升，周末雲量增多及有幾陣驟雨。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.457011+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:06:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:19.806842+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:06.713974+00:00","content_hash":"75d0248d525ab4c0251d719cdde3ecd2f6cbbcac65185b591b127d03bd96fdf5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}